@startuml diagram4_activity
!theme plain
title "Spare Part Request Creation & Live Interlock Detection Flow - Activity Diagram"

' --- STYLING & PALETTE (Linear/Stripe Enterprise) ---
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI, Inter, Arial, sans-serif"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontColor #0F172A
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam arrowColor #4F46E5
skinparam arrowThickness 1.2

skinparam activity {
    BorderColor #4F46E5
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    FontColor #0F172A
    BorderThickness 1.2
    StartColor #4F46E5
    EndColor #10B981
}

skinparam activityDiamond {
    BorderColor #4F46E5
    BackgroundColor #EEF2FF
    FontColor #1E1B4B
}

skinparam partition {
    BorderColor #CBD5E1
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    FontColor #334155
    FontStyle bold
}

skinparam note {
    BorderColor #F59E0B
    BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
    FontColor #92400E
    FontSize 11
}

' --- SWIMLANES ---
|#F8FAFC|Requestor (Line Engineer)|
|#FFFFFF|SP-FLOW Frontend UI|
|#EFF6FF|EMS / ERP Gateway|
|#ECFDF5|Enterprise Database|

|Requestor (Line Engineer)|
start
:Access Item Request Form (Wizard);
:Input Item Code (e.g., "SP-2024-M08");
:Click "Load EMS Details";

|SP-FLOW Frontend UI|
:Send lookup request to EMS endpoint\n`GET /api/v2/ems/item-master/{code}`;

|EMS / ERP Gateway|
:Query SAP Material Master Table (MARA);
if (Item Code exists in Master DB?) then (Yes: Registered Item)
    :Retrieve Item Details:\n- Name & Detailed Specs\n- High-res Image URL\n- MOQ (Minimum Order Qty)\n- Lead Time (Days)\n- Factory Stock in Warehouse A & B;
    |SP-FLOW Frontend UI|
    :Auto-populate Item Details Preview Card;
    
    ' --- LIVE INTERLOCK CHECK BRANCH ---
    if (Warehouse Stock > 0?) then (Yes: Stock Found)
        #FEF2F2:<b>Display RED Interlock Warning Card:</b>\n"⚠️ INTERLOCK DETECTED: Stock available in Warehouse A (5 pcs).\nPlease submit a Material Issue Request first.";
        
        |Requestor (Line Engineer)|
        if (Can reuse existing warehouse stock?) then (Yes: Re-utilize Stock)
            :Click "Go to Warehouse Work Order Issue";
            :Submit Material Issue under Work Order (WO);
            stop
        else (No: Line Leader Emergency Override)
            :Check "Bypass with Line Leader Emergency Justification";
            :Enter Line Leader Name & Stoppage Override Reason;
            note right
              <b>Corporate Compliance:</b>
              Override justification is permanently
              audited in InterlockLog to prevent
              unauthorized duplicate inventory purchasing.
            end note
        endif
        |SP-FLOW Frontend UI|
    else (No: Zero Plant Stock)
        #ECFDF5:<b>Display GREEN Status Badge:</b>\n"✅ Interlock OK: Zero Available Stock in Warehouse";
    endif

else (No: Uncataloged Part)
    |SP-FLOW Frontend UI|
    #FEF3C7:<b>Display Notice:</b>\n"Unregistered Item Code in EMS Master";
    |Requestor (Line Engineer)|
    :Open "New Part Registration" sub-form;
    :Manually input Technical Specifications & Target Vendor;
endif

|Requestor (Line Engineer)|
:Select <b>Classification & Location</b>:\n- Purchase Reason (Routine, Breakdown, Improvement)\n- Category (Mechanical, Electrical, Pneumatic, Consumables)\n- Target Process & Line Number (e.g., Line 02 - SMT);

:Input <b>Logic & Quantity Rationale</b>:\n- Free-Text Logic Justification (Machine hours, MTBF, failure alarm)\n- Requested Quantity (Numeric) & Unit (Pcs/Set)\n- Expected Date of Use;

:Click "Submit Request to PIC Review Hub";

|SP-FLOW Frontend UI|
:Validate required fields & Interlock conditions;
if (Form Valid & (Stock == 0 OR Override Justified)?) then (Yes)
    :Assemble JSON Payload;
    :POST /api/v2/requests/submit;
    
    |Enterprise Database|
    :Insert new record in `SparePartRequest`:\n- `status` = "Pending PIC Review"\n- `stage` = "pic_review"\n- `interlockStatus` = (OK or Stock Found with Override);
    if (Override Justified?) then (Yes)
        :Insert audit record into `InterlockLog`;
    endif
    
    |SP-FLOW Frontend UI|
    :Trigger Toast: "Spare Part Request Submitted Successfully";
    :Redirect Requestor to Workspace Task Center;
    
    |Requestor (Line Engineer)|
    :View newly created request in Active Requisition Table;
    stop
else (No: Interlock Violation or Missing Logic)
    |SP-FLOW Frontend UI|
    #FEF2F2:Highlight missing fields or un-overridden interlock error;
    |Requestor (Line Engineer)|
    :Review error notes and adjust inputs;
    stop
endif

@enduml
